Package: faiss-termux
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: termux-learn-crypto <vilasrmeshram400@gmail.com>
Depends: glibc-repo, glibc-runner, python-glibc, python-pip-glibc
Section: python
Priority: optional
Description: FAISS for Termux - vector database / similarity search
 Facebook AI Similarity Search: nearest-neighbor search over embeddings,
 fully on CPU. Termux (bionic) has no faiss wheels; the PyPI
 manylinux aarch64 wheels need glibc. This installs the glibc
 toolchain, a glibc Python 3.12 and faiss-cpu into it; your python3
 (bionic) is untouched. Commands: faiss-python, faiss-check,
 faiss-setup. Set FAISS_SKIP_SETUP=1 during apt install to skip the
 setup (run faiss-setup later); FAISS_VERSION=1.16.0 pins faiss.
